					"content": "哇，今天的奥摩斯港闻上去香喷喷的，连海风的味道都要被压下去了呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660302,
					"content": "听说，这里是花车巡游的终点，很多商家提前布置摊位，自然会比平时更热闹些。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "坎蒂丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660303,
					"content": "阿如村最近也来了不少商人，大家都在准备过一个难忘的花神诞祭呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "坎蒂丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660304,
					"content": "嘿嘿，看来不愁买不到东西了！砍价这事就交给我们吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660305,
					"content": "好，那就…唔…！呃…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660306,
						401660307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "坎蒂丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660306,
					"content": "怎么了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660308
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401660308,
					"content": "我没事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "坎蒂丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660309,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "坎蒂丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660310,
					"content": "抱歉，让你们担心了。我们先去那家店订些东西吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "坎蒂丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660311,
					"content": "哟，欢迎光临，客人想吃些什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贾汉吉尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660312,
					"content": "想订一些花神诞祭当日的小吃，大概在花车巡游结束后来取，到时候能帮我提前做好吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "坎蒂丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660313,
					"content": "外带的预定单是吧？没问题，您到时候要吃些什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贾汉吉尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660314,
					"content": "马萨拉芝士球和土豆船各三份，绿汁脆球十人份，咖喱虾也要三份。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "坎蒂丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660315,
					"content": "稍等我记一下…土豆船…绿汁脆球…嗯，没问题，这些食材都管够，客人还真是大手笔。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贾汉吉尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660316,
					"content": "买这么多的话，请问能便宜一些吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "坎蒂丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660317,
					"content": "当然可以！我算算啊…一共两万九千摩拉，打个折算您两万六怎么样？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贾汉吉尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660318,
					"content": "两万摩拉可以吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "坎蒂丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660319,
					"content": "欸…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660320,
					"content": "（坎蒂丝…砍价好凶…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660321
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401660321,
					"content": "呃…这，这多少有点为难我了。花车巡游当天我这儿的客人也不少，食材也得专门为您留一留…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贾汉吉尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660322,
					"content": "这样吗…那我再加五份萨巴桑炸角怎么样？能再便宜一些吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "坎蒂丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660323,
					"content": "啊，这样的话…我最多给客人您打到八折…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贾汉吉尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660324,
					"content": "好吧，那就八折，辛苦您了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "坎蒂丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660325,
					"content": "应该的应该的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贾汉吉尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660326,
					"content": "总感觉坎蒂丝比我们还会砍价呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660327,
					"content": "另外…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "坎蒂丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660328,
					"content": "客人还有什么想要的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660329
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贾汉吉尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660329,
					"content": "没有了。只是想提醒您检查一下炉火，用得久了，可能会存有安全隐患。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660330
					],
					"speakerTitle": "坎蒂丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660330,
					"content": "哦，谢谢客人关心。不过这是我今天刚换的一批炭料，绝对不会…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660331
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贾汉吉尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660331,
					"content": "（嘭——！）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660332
					],
					"speakerTitle": "（test）音效用"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660332,
					"content": "呜啊！咳咳…好大的烟！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660333
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660333,
					"content": "唔咳咳…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660334
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贾汉吉尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660334,
					"content": "您没事吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660335
					],
					"speakerTitle": "坎蒂丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660335,
					"content": "没事…没事…谢谢您。咦？真是奇怪…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660336
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贾汉吉尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660336,
					"content": "是不是鼓风装置出了故障？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660337
					],
					"speakerTitle": "坎蒂丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660337,
					"content": "咳咳…的确有可能，前阵子也出过类似的事，我才换的鼓风…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660338
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贾汉吉尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660338,
					"content": "炉子的问题可以晚些再排查，您人没事才是最重要的。要喝些水吗？我身上有带。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660339
					],
					"speakerTitle": "坎蒂丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660339,
					"content": "不要紧不要紧，也是客人您眼睛好，要是您今天早些到我店里提醒我，说不定就不会这样了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660340
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贾汉吉尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660340,
					"content": "总之，我今天就赶紧修修这炉子，不会耽搁您花神诞祭当天的订单。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660341
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贾汉吉尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660341,
					"content": "还是身体和安全要紧，您慢慢来。订金我就放这儿了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660342
					],
					"speakerTitle": "坎蒂丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660342,
					"content": "好，客人您慢走。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660343
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贾汉吉尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660343,
					"content": "刚才真是危险呢！还好坎蒂丝你反应快。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660344
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660344,
					"content": "你怎么知道炉火有问题？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660345
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401660345,
					"content": "唔…或许是冥冥之中的感觉吧？我说不清…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660346
					],
					"speakerTitle": "坎蒂丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660346,
					"content": "呼…接下来去哪里？希望是个没有炉子的地方，我真被吓得不轻。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660347
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660347,
					"content": "去买些水果吧，在制作糖果时会用到。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660348
					],
					"speakerTitle": "坎蒂丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660348,
					"content": "好！我们也好久没逛奥摩斯港了呢，顺带买点其他东西吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401660307,
					"content": "身体不舒服吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401660308
					]
				}
			]
		},
